&lt;li&gt;Experience developing community programming such as AMAs, virtual events, member spotlights, and recurring engagement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience identifying and amplifying community stories, projects, or contributor achievements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience collaborating with Product, Developer Relations, Engineering, Marketing, or Support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness and ability to travel occasionally to support community events, meetups, and other initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
