&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced full-stack Documentation Platform Engineer to evolve our&lt;a href=&quot;https://tailscale.com/docs&quot;&gt; documentation&lt;/a&gt; site into a platform that delivers an exceptional experience for Tailscale&#39;s prospective and current customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build, maintain, evolve, and support the platform and tools that internal teams and external contributors use to showcase Tailscale&#39;s features and products. This includes the documentation platform itself, our content pipelines, API documentation, and search. You&#39;ll work on a highly-visible customer-facing documentation site and you&#39;ll influence how documentation gets created, published, and consumed.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously improve and evolve our documentation site to create a helpful, delightful, and educational experience that helps homelabbers, developers, and enterprises (and their agents) get the most of out of Tailscale&#39;s products and features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and expand our docs-as-code tooling and content publishing pipelines, ensuring a smooth experience for both internal and external contributors to publish error-free content quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with other engineering and product teams to integrate documentation with the Tailscale platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with designers, user research, and growth teams to implement designs and features as they move from experimentation to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help shape and tune a modern search and discovery infrastructure to help visitors, and agents, discover answers quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with open source contributors through GitHub discussions, issues, and pull requests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor the platform&#39;s performance and maintain scalability for millions of visitors per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay ahead of documentation trends through research, experimentation, and measuring results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
