&lt;p&gt;Because we’re an early-stage, fully remote company, we’re looking for someone who works with full autonomy. You’ll turn broad goals into clear strategies, decide what’s worth pursuing, and build alignment at every level. You’ll report to the Manager, Program Management.&lt;/p&gt;
